# CrowdSec acquisition — RouterOS (MikroTik) logs (HD-313)
#
# The RB4011 (and switch/APs) forward RFC5424 syslog to the VPS host rsyslog
# UDP/514 receiver, which writes /var/log/remote-syslog/routeros.log (host
# filesystem). CrowdSec tails that file; the a1ad/mikrotik-logs parser
# (installed via the `a1ad/mikrotik` collection) extracts auth failures +
# firewall drops for the mikrotik-bf / mikrotik-scan-multi_ports scenarios.
# Upstream-blessed pattern (a1ad/mikrotik collection README):
#   source: syslog (remote rsyslog) -> CrowdSec file acquisition
---
filenames:
  - /var/log/remote-syslog/routeros.log
labels:
  type: mikrotik